    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_016:7c4fd7f3",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C04_414_01",
        "key": "414_01_016",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_016:7c4fd7f3",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_016:7c4fd7f3",
        "jp_sha256": "e99f5f1eed89775a00b7529e4d0f17e5c8fd3685da383ca7832f597ffeb729d5",
        "official_en_sha256": "131b888613c84378f4132318a2d23dfb381b6fd3edc8ad9ab30f132d366eaf9f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これは反乱軍が手に入れた、たしかな情報だ。\r\nこのままだとゾルダードもグランシェルトも、\r\n大勢の民が犠牲になっちまう。",
        "official_en": "Trust me when I say it’s intel from a reliable source. If we don’t do something, folks from both Zoldaad and Grandshelt will be killed.",
        "real_en": "The rebels obtained reliable information about it. If things go on like this, many people in both Zoldaad and Grandshelt will die."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C04_414_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "ジェイク",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0074",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C04_414_01/414_01_016"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_010:dde72b41",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C04_414_01",
        "key": "414_01_010",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_010:dde72b41",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C04_414_01:414_01_010:dde72b41",
        "jp_sha256": "cd77fd29cf7a64e9e620ee16cfc305719e793f198110a8af508053dbcbfbe47f",
        "official_en_sha256": "cc506d76cd8a75c287fb6b9f6f754ae210852741086aa27ddcd6bc5d8086bf43"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そう怒りなさんなって。\r\nどのみち帝都にいたら帝国兵に\r\n捕まっていたんだからよ。",
        "official_en": "Hey, cool down. No matter how you slice it, those soldiers would’ve arrested you in the capital.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
