        "official_en_sha256": "52e659d606bd4147122656dea05fe88e560443b0237e8d28c04a425ced7daa1d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それに、この話はお前たちにとっても\r\n無関係ではないはずだぞ。",
        "official_en": "Besides, you’re all a part of this, too.",
        "real_en": "Besides, this should concern you, too."
      },
