      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、グランシェルトの騎士が\r\n反乱軍に協力すれば問題になりかねないぞ。",
        "official_en": "But if the knights of Grandshelt form an alliance with the rebellion, that could have serious consequences.",
        "real_en": null
